## Integration acceptance

- Filter and sort with some selected rows inside the visible results and some outside, and check the stated number of targets.
- Check success, rejection, partial and not-confirmed results, with no copy that assumes every record succeeded.
- Check sorting, selection and actions by keyboard, and that device, entity and category operations are told apart.

Record the actual environment, versions, state, method and result using [Native task accessibility and evidence](native-task-accessibility.html). A source review or a local example does not show physical behaviour, screen-reader use or live compatibility.
